      <p class="eyebrow">On now, in Gallery One</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">The Living Embroideries of Kutch</h2>
      <p class="section-intro__copy">An ongoing show celebrating the rich, diverse and awe-inspiring embroideries of twelve different Kutchi communities. The exhibits include traditionally embroidered textiles alongside specially commissioned pieces and contemporary expressions — all at the highest levels of creative and technical excellence.</p>
    </div>

